   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ばかりか: not only... but also",
     "texto": [
      "To add something surprising, after what you already know: noun or sentence + **ばかり か**: **かれ は べんきょう ばかり か、 スポーツ も じょうず です** (he not only studies, he's also good at sports).",
      "It sounds like surprise or praise."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜だけでなく: not only... also",
     "texto": [
      "To add something to what has already been said, without the surprise: noun + **だけ で なく**: **にほんご だけ で なく、 えいご も はなせます** (not only do I speak Japanese, I also speak English).",
      "It's more neutral than **ばかりか**, though the emphasis depends on the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
